    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"just existing\" feels like a joke. it's not enough. everything i was, everything i was supposed to achieve, it's just... over. the silence is so loud. it feels less like a transition and more like a finality. like there's no point in even trying to breathe when the person who was supposed to do something great is just... gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
